<title>PHILIPPINES: Metrobank sets ex-rights date on Feb 5.</title>
<headline>Metrobank sets ex-rights date on Feb 5.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metropolitan Bank and Trust Co (Metrobank) said on Tuesday the ex-date for its one for 30.88 stock rights offering had been set for February 5.</p>
<p>The bank is selling new shares at 670 pesos each. The rights offer involves 5.882 million shares.</p>
<p>Metrobank shares were traded at 680 pesos in late trade on Tuesday, down five pesos from Monday's close.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
